            "multiple": true,
            "typeClass": "primitive",
            "value": [
              "Primarily preporatory vocational (vmbo) secondary school students from the province South Holland (N=148). The datacollection for this pilot took place at 2 schools in The Hague. It was conducted partly by paper and pencil and partly on the computer. Comparison did not result in large differences, students seemed to like the computer better."
